   "source": "community",
   "text": "Worked a bit o' a trade with the Dun Garok brew-kin. We're not the only ones missin' the vineyards of the Fallrook family, it seems! Most o' the best bottled years are long since drank, but we do have cases of the wine still in the cellars. \r\n\r\nBring this case of Fallrook Varietal to Dun Garok in the southeast and leave it with 'em by their gatherin' fireplace at the bottom of their fort.\r\n\r\nIn return, carry a sack o' the Homebrew Hops back with ye.\r\n\r\nThat keep is the closest thing to home around here!",
